Z||000013||AL||08-21-2000||08:34 PM||||no they don't take up to much room,what i did is added a metal piece on top of where i was mounting the lights and then drilled holes in the facia and the metal piece so when the screw went in it would tighten enough to hold the lights in,i'm just like you for the look, i bought them at autozone 24 bucks. <P><B>AL</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif">  <P><p>[This message has been edited by AL (edited 08-21-2000).]||||reg||1
